msgstr "``dataClass`` and ``action`` are required. The combination ``transactional=true`` and ``exclusive=false`` is prohibited."

#: ../../general/Core_mechanisms/Events.rst:80
msgid ""
"``addListener`` возвращает ``ListenerHandle`` с методом ``remove()``. "
"Также доступны ``eventsService.removeListener(id)`` и удаление по "
"конфигурации."
msgstr "``addListener`` returns a ``ListenerHandle`` with a ``remove()`` method. You can also use ``eventsService.removeListener(id)`` or remove a listener by configuration."

